WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.138 --> 00:00:03.475
- She took a picture of a piece
of poop and sent it to me.

00:00:03.475 --> 00:00:04.796
- (laughs)

00:00:04.796 --> 00:00:07.276
- Like, that's what happens
when you are married with kids.

00:00:07.276 --> 00:00:09.410
That's real life right there.

00:00:09.410 --> 00:00:12.507
(relaxing music)

00:00:12.507 --> 00:00:14.140
- I had three pregnancy tests

00:00:14.140 --> 00:00:15.475
on the table when he entered,

00:00:15.475 --> 00:00:17.181
and I was like, "If he sees it,

00:00:17.181 --> 00:00:19.299
that's perfect. I don't
have to do anything."

00:00:19.299 --> 00:00:20.539
- I didn't see it.
- And he didn't see it.

00:00:20.539 --> 00:00:22.239
- I can't believe this is real sometimes.

00:00:22.239 --> 00:00:23.405
- (laughs)

00:00:23.405 --> 00:00:24.238
I know.

00:00:24.238 --> 00:00:25.205
Once a day,

00:00:25.205 --> 00:00:27.172
I feel like we look at each
other and we're like, "Man.

00:00:27.172 --> 00:00:28.005
We're parents.

00:00:28.005 --> 00:00:29.019
Weird, right?"
- What?

00:00:29.019 --> 00:00:30.578
- Before you have kids,
you look at kids as like,

00:00:30.578 --> 00:00:33.236
oh, what a funny little,
slightly dirty thing.

00:00:33.236 --> 00:00:34.069
Go back to mommy.

00:00:34.069 --> 00:00:36.599
And then, when you have kids,
I mean nothing's off-limits.

00:00:36.599 --> 00:00:38.339
She loves to do a pterodactyl screech,

00:00:38.339 --> 00:00:39.659
I'll screech right with her.

00:00:39.659 --> 00:00:42.449
Yeah, when we're walking down
the street, we look odd going

00:00:42.449 --> 00:00:44.484
(screeches)

00:00:44.484 --> 00:00:45.879
But, like, we're connecting.

00:00:45.879 --> 00:00:47.131
It's fun for us.

00:00:47.131 --> 00:00:48.311
- Sometimes it's disgusting.

00:00:48.311 --> 00:00:49.859
I mean she has a giant blow-out,

00:00:49.859 --> 00:00:50.914
and you're just so proud of her.

00:00:50.914 --> 00:00:53.529
You're like, "God, she's
gotta feel good right now."

00:00:53.529 --> 00:00:55.559
- One thing for sure that I
didn't think I was gonna do

00:00:55.559 --> 00:00:57.412
was have that cutesy dialogue.

00:00:57.412 --> 00:00:59.358
"How's mamma's baby?"

00:00:59.358 --> 00:01:00.191
And I have this,

00:01:00.191 --> 00:01:03.219
I didn't even know my
voice could go that high.

00:01:03.219 --> 00:01:04.549
Times done changed.

00:01:04.549 --> 00:01:07.079
(pop music)

00:01:07.079 --> 00:01:08.399
- Pretty much everything I do now

00:01:08.399 --> 00:01:10.899
is something I said I wouldn't
do before I was pregnant.

00:01:10.899 --> 00:01:12.799
- Now that I've become a dad,
- Oh.

00:01:12.799 --> 00:01:16.259
- I've been falling asleep on
the spot, like, outta nowhere.

00:01:16.259 --> 00:01:17.346
It's time to go to (laughs)
- Yeah, the other night,

00:01:17.346 --> 00:01:18.775
he was asleep like this.

00:01:18.775 --> 00:01:20.010
- There's a lot of changes for me.

00:01:20.010 --> 00:01:22.479
I was an inconsiderate woman before.

00:01:22.479 --> 00:01:23.950
I'm nicer, you know,

00:01:23.950 --> 00:01:25.756
I talk to people more.

00:01:25.756 --> 00:01:26.839
You're raising someone who's looking

00:01:26.839 --> 00:01:28.579
at your every single move.

00:01:28.579 --> 00:01:30.299
(uplifting music)

00:01:30.299 --> 00:01:33.999
- I love it when Brooklyn smiles for sure.

00:01:33.999 --> 00:01:35.039
- When Flynn stretches.

00:01:35.039 --> 00:01:37.339
- Her arms are like this.
- (laughs)

00:01:37.339 --> 00:01:38.731
That's as far as she can go.
- She has, like,

00:01:38.731 --> 00:01:40.322
these monster stretches. They're so cute.

00:01:40.322 --> 00:01:42.479
- I love it when London laughs.

00:01:42.479 --> 00:01:44.434
- (laughs)

00:01:44.434 --> 00:01:46.926
- Gives me open mouth kisses.
- I love it...

00:01:46.926 --> 00:01:48.843
- Ahhhh.
- No, no, no.

00:01:48.843 --> 00:01:50.373
With all the slobber.

00:01:50.373 --> 00:01:51.314
- She said, "mamma."

00:01:51.314 --> 00:01:52.967
So, I get out the camera, and I'm like,

00:01:52.967 --> 00:01:55.130
"I'm gonna show off
what a great mom I am."

00:01:55.130 --> 00:01:56.340
Who's this?

00:01:56.340 --> 00:01:57.173
Mamma?

00:01:58.437 --> 00:01:59.979
- (hiccups)

00:01:59.979 --> 00:02:00.850
- Oh.

00:02:00.850 --> 00:02:02.947
That's what you get when
you try to show off.

00:02:02.947 --> 00:02:05.379
(uplifting guitar music)

00:02:05.379 --> 00:02:06.799
- There's that aspect of wanting

00:02:06.799 --> 00:02:09.179
to pass on everything that you know.

00:02:09.179 --> 00:02:12.379
I also look forward to
experiencing things with her

00:02:12.379 --> 00:02:14.039
that I've never experienced before.

00:02:14.039 --> 00:02:16.179
- I can't wait to teach
her about stupid things

00:02:16.179 --> 00:02:17.387
like gravity and

00:02:17.387 --> 00:02:18.438
- (laughs)

00:02:18.438 --> 00:02:19.839
- time dilation.

00:02:19.839 --> 00:02:23.019
- I remember when I first came
out, my dad's main sadness,

00:02:23.019 --> 00:02:25.359
I think, about it was that
he really wanted to see

00:02:25.359 --> 00:02:29.089
what kind of dad I would be. And then...

00:02:29.089 --> 00:02:30.917
And then, now we can.

00:02:30.917 --> 00:02:35.074
- I would much rather be
single and a kick-ass mom

00:02:35.074 --> 00:02:37.240
than be miserable in a relationship.

00:02:37.240 --> 00:02:40.253
- I wanna go visit my pregnant self

00:02:40.253 --> 00:02:42.840
and be like, "don't panic."

00:02:42.840 --> 00:02:45.333
- Thanks, Flynn, for making me

00:02:45.333 --> 00:02:48.062
forget about my to-do lists.

00:02:48.062 --> 00:02:50.677
- I look forward to that
moment of walking in the door

00:02:50.677 --> 00:02:52.417
and seeing you just smile

00:02:52.417 --> 00:02:55.388
and have that huge grin on your face.

00:02:55.388 --> 00:02:58.709
- It has been truly
incredible to be your mother

00:02:58.709 --> 00:03:00.599
and I love every single day of it.

00:03:00.599 --> 00:03:02.577
- Yeah! Good girl, good girl!

00:03:02.577 --> 00:03:03.997
- I know you're gonna
be one of the good ones.

00:03:03.997 --> 00:03:06.557
I know you're gonna make
the world a better place.

00:03:06.557 --> 00:03:08.657
- You have changed my entire life.

00:03:08.657 --> 00:03:10.512
- Changed my outlook on love.

00:03:10.512 --> 00:03:11.537
- All for the better.

00:03:11.537 --> 00:03:15.152
- I hope that I can make a
difference in your life like

00:03:15.152 --> 00:03:17.069
my dad has in mine, and

00:03:18.397 --> 00:03:20.297
just be there for you.

00:03:20.297 --> 00:03:23.177
- Thank you for making my life worth it.

00:03:23.177 --> 00:03:25.010
- You're my heartbeat.

00:03:30.348 --> 00:03:31.765
- I never thought

00:03:33.012 --> 00:03:36.345
that I'd poop holding onto someone else.

